Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:06.46,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647.273,367.691)}Episode 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:06.46,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(652.727,542.727)}The Chain-Link Stratagem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:51.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(347.273,507.273)}Sūn Jiān\NStyled: "Wéntái"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! We've found a person in a well!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, they have found someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.11,0:01:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:16.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(311.818,504.545)}Huáng Gài\NStyled: "Gōngfù"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens! My lord, congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:23.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(313.182,504.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,300,1790,2140)}Chéng Pǔ\NStyled: "Démóu"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's {\i1}the Heirloom Seal of the Realm!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The {\i1}Heirloom Seal?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.94,0:02:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of old, Biàn Hé, at the foot of Mount Jīngshān, saw a phoenix perching on a stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He presented the stone to King Wén of Chǔ,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}he ordered it to be cracked open, finding a piece of jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.65,0:02:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}It would be known as {\i1}the Jade of Hé!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Later, Qín Shǐ Huáng ordered his artisans to carve a seal from the jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and Lǐ Sī engraved those eight characters on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Once, Qín Shǐ Huáng was patrolling Dòngtíng lake, and a violent storm erupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The ship was about to sink so he threw the jade into the lake, the storm receded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Eight years later, when Shǐ Huáng was inspecting Huáyīn,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}a passerby presented him with the same seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Thus, the Jade Seal was returned to Qín.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The next year, Qín Shǐ Huáng passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Eventually, his grandson, Ziyīng, would relinquish the jade Seal to Gāozǔ of Hàn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Thereafter it has been known as the Heirloom Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, we can't stay here! We must hurry back to Jiāngdōng! Plan our next move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That is exactly what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will report sick, then leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,474.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,415,1581,1581)}Yuán Shào\NStyled: "Běnchū"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've caught a slight ailment, so I need to return to Chǎngshā.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to bid farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What illness? Could it be the illness of the Jade Seal!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you speak thus?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We have risen against a traitor, to rid the empire of a menace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seal belongs to the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, since you have it,\Nyou ought to bring it to our camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,After eliminating Dǒng Zhuō, I will return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you hide it and wish to scurry away!\NWhat is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That... how could the Heirloom Seal be within my possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.07,0:04:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the object in the\N well near Jiànzhāng hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have it! Why interrogate me so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Return it now, or you will suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By the high Heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If I indeed have the Seal and am hiding it for myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,may I meet a painful end, struck by arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Wéntái has made such an oath,\Nperhaps he doesn't have the Seal after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When you salvaged it, was this fellow present?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare deceive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Report! Sir, Cáo Cāo led his army to pursue Dǒng Zhuō.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He was ambushed and routed! He's now returning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder that he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare a banquet behind the tent to settle Mèngdé's mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.637,493.637)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: "Mèngdé"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mèngdé.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mèngdé, don't be upset. \NVictory and defeat are all part of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I fought for great justice, to rid the empire of a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}From eighteen directions, came armies fighting for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My heart was grateful...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Utmost gratitude...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I was to have Běnchū rally the people in Hénèi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}lead them to Mèngjīn and Suānzǎo, with the lords to guard Chénggāo,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.23,0:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}seize Yaocang, obstruct Huányuán and Dagu. Secure the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Gōnglù! You were to lead the men of Nányáng,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}garrison Dānxī, and enter Wǔ pass, to strike at the capital province!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Dig in our trenches and fortify our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Not to fight, but to threaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We could direct the tides of war, and thus pacify the land!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yet, you hesitate and refuse to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We have lost the world's hope in us...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}For shame... for shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:46.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(377.273,504.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,550,1900,2300)}Gōngsūn Zàn\NStyled: "Bóguī"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:21.50,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Going through the Wormwood" ("蒿里行") \Nby Cáo Cāo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:21.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}There rose men righteous in the east,\Nled legions to quell the terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:27.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}They first had gathered at Méngjīn, \Nfor their hearts that lay in Xiányáng.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:32.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet formations were divided,\N wavering like geese misguided,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:36.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}As greed had drove them to contend, and each dealt each a deadly end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:41.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now Huáinán has a monarch made.\NIn north, one carved a seal of jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:47.10,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Referring to Yuán Shù and Yuán Shào. Yuán Shù would declare himself Emperor, \NYuán Shào would attempt to make Liú Yú emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:45.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Armor teems with lice and fleas, \Nlives ten thousands are deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:49.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sun-bleached bones lie on the field,\Nfor a thousand {\i1}li{\i0} no roosters shrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:55.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}All lives but one lost in its wake, \Nreflecting breaks the heart with ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen? Ministers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:22.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.182,484.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,575,5460,5740)}Dǒng Zhuō\NStyled: "Zhòngyǐng"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Those eighteen renegades are now in utter shambles, fragmented and split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They've already begun to eat each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now general Sūn Jiān is killed by the hands of Liú Biǎo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiáo Mào killed by Liú Dài!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.11,0:10:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hán Fù lost Jì Province and fled to Zhāng Miǎo for shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And that Yuán Shào and Gōngsūn Zàn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All willing to submit to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.03,0:10:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, you are all veteran ministers of the dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you remain loyal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your old friend here can promise you prestige, rank, and wealth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, {\i1}Grand Preceptor,{\i0} for your great virtue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.22,0:11:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Put them all to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I moved the capital and led you all here, I never got to feast with you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I shall be your host!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen? Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:46.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.545,497.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,575,3100,3500)}Wáng Yǔn\NStyled: "Zishī"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, no worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhāng Wēn conspired with Yuán Shù!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They planned to harm me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuán Shù snuck a letter for him, but by accident, my son, Fèngxiān,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,discovered it, and so he was executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, brother Běnchū?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You wench!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:53.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(969.091,484.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,350,3425,3860)}Diāochán
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sobbing and sighing late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you have an affair?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, how could I have an affair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may speak with honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Diāo Chán has received your generosity for sixteen years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,teaching me to sing and dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Treating me with great kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I were crushed into dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't be enough to repay a thousandth part of your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I saw you anxious, instead of joyful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect there must be a great state affair worrying you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but I dare not ask too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I noticed that you broke down and refused to eat, nervous at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.15,0:17:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate myself for not being \Nable to ease your worries,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.87,0:17:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have been sighing \Nat the moon instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to notice, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you ever have a use for me,\NI will not back down even under threat of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could've thought the fate of\Nthe great Hàn Empire rests within your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you don't need to! \NThis is more than I will ever deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you ever have a use for me,\NI will not back down, even after 10,000 deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:19:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Right now, the people are in great peril.\NBoth the Emperor and his ministers are in jeopardy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But it's not as if you cannot help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The traitorous Dǒng Zhuō wants to usurp the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.95,0:19:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}All officials of the court are unable to oppose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now Dǒng Zhuó has an adopted son by the name of Lü Bù.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His power is extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.74,0:19:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I have observed that both Dǒng Zhuó and Lü Bù are lecherous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}So I wish to employ a Chain-Link Stratagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}First, I would let Lü Bù marry you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and at the same time, present you to Dǒng Zhuō!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If you can go in between them, you can strain the relationship between father and son!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Eventually, it will provoke Lü Bù to murder the traitor, and end a great evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With that, it would restore the land once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Could you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I already said it. Just give the order. \NI won't leave, even if it means death!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, just do what you must, I know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If this discussion gets out, our family will be exterminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.65,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, don't grieve!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't repay your great kindness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,may I be cut to death by a thousand knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am beyond grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:50.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(971.818,512.727)}Lü Bù\NStyled: "Fèngxiān"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.47,0:22:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're enjoying yourself out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.47,0:22:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Excellency of the Masses,{\i0} it's not often I see you in the hunting grounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you catch any game?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, no game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After I settled here, I often go out \Nwith my family to admire the nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you, sir, would like to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.39,0:22:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir, but the Grand Preceptor has orders for me. I dare not tarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do so, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.11,0:22:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do come visit me later on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.87,0:23:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.75,0:23:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not expect you to come! \NPlease excuse me for my discourtesy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.49,0:23:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, it's alright, it's alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.35,0:23:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.22,0:23:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.15,0:23:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take the seat of honor, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.67,0:23:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.90,0:23:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you are a Ducal Minister,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am just an officer! How could I accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.54,0:24:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You should take it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.23,0:24:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you must be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.90,0:24:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the realm today, many people claim to be heroes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.51,0:24:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but only you, general, are worthy enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.67,0:24:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not honoring you because of your rank, but because of your abilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.11,0:24:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, sir, refuse to claim the seat. \NCould it be that you look down on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.67,0:24:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! But if so, please allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.55,0:24:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.71,0:24:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall offer a cup for the Grand Preceptor, and for you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.27,0:24:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.83,0:25:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the Grand Preceptor's longevity!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For the General's health! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.55,0:25:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.26,0:25:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.63,0:26:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General? General!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.18,0:26:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.35,0:26:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you seen General Lü before?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.75,0:26:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, who is this lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.18,0:26:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My humble daughter, Diāochán.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I pay my respects, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.55,0:26:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No need! No need!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.67,0:26:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General, there's no need to be formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.34,0:26:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've shown us charity, and so I view you as part of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.34,0:26:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, I told my daughter to come here so that she may see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.22,0:26:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My child, would you serve\N a cup for the General?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.11,0:27:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.90,0:27:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.95,0:27:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, even in my chamber,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.94,0:27:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've long heard of your reputation,\Nyour name echoes like thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.95,0:27:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I look up to you, sir, I have made this cap\Nto express my admiration, just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.75,0:27:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It is just a token of my respect. \NI hope you do not laugh at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.42,0:27:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, not only are you clever and deft,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.67,0:28:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but you are also very beautiful and pure! Your speech is elegant as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.95,0:28:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, you may sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.86,0:28:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The General is a good friend.\NMy child, do take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.39,0:28:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.83,0:28:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.99,0:28:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to give you my\N daughter as a concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.99,0:28:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you will accept\N or refuse my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.67,0:28:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Since that is the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.66,0:29:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am at your complete service,\Nso that I may repay you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.50,0:29:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, we must set a date\N for an auspicious day
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.50,0:29:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring my daughter\N to your residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.26,0:29:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Exalted father-in-law, I shall accept your courtesy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.66,0:29:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be so formal!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.91,0:29:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General. General!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future, my family\N will rely on you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.87,0:29:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you are flattering me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.35,0:29:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's night already.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.11,0:30:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I intended for you to stay the night, \Nbut then Zhòngyǐng will grow suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.47,0:30:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's midnight already. \NI'll thank you another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.19,0:30:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I drank too much tonight, so I am not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.33,0:30:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon. I'll let my daughter accompany you, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.55,0:30:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.43,0:31:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Court dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.95,0:31:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.91,0:31:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fèngxiān!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.59,0:31:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to go {\i1}Méiwù{\i0}-manor to escort munitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.59,0:31:52.06,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Méiwù ({\fnYu Gothic}郿坞{\fn}) was Dong Zhuo's real-life fortified manor, located 250 {\i1}li{\i0} from Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.71,0:31:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I also need you to lead some troops to be garrisoned, just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.75,0:31:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, please ease yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.27,0:32:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will surely return within three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.18,0:32:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may dare, sir, can I ask you visit my humble abode for a banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.59,0:32:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you, sir, feel about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.07,0:32:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If the exalted Excellency of the Masses wants me to go, how could I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.95,0:32:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You flatter me! I am unworthy \Nof the Grand Preceptor's grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.18,0:32:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really have come! \NI present my humble respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.18,0:32:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.07,0:33:18.34,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Duke Wen of Zhou helped found the Zhou dynasty, considered the forefather of Confucian virtues.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.07,0:33:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, your majestic virtue towers over \NYī Yǐn and the Duke of Zhōu!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.34,0:33:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For you to have visited my humble abode gives me enough fortune to last three lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.35,0:33:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.26,0:33:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Preceptor,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.71,0:34:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,please drink a cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.03,0:34:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish the Grand Preceptor a prosperous life!\NYour virtue is enough to overflow the Four Seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.15,0:34:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.15,0:34:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}From a young age, I have studied astronomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.15,0:34:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lately, I observed an odd phenomenon at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.47,0:34:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and knew the days of the Hàn reign are waning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.11,0:34:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, your virtue echoes throughout the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.07,0:34:44.78,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Shùn, Yáo and Yǔ are the mythical rulers of the era of Three Sovereigns and Five Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.07,0:34:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}like Shùn succeeding Yáo and Yǔ succeeding Shùn
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.14,0:34:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to finish their great cause, meet the hopes of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.07,0:34:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, you can't disobey the will of Heaven and the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.94,0:34:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How could I dare do so?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.94,0:34:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Of old, those with principles fought those without it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.94,0:35:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}those without virtue submitted to those with it. Sir, if you take over the realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.70,0:35:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}it would be in concert with the will of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.95,0:35:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If the Mandate of Heaven is indeed mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.27,0:35:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}then you, gracious Ducal Excellency of the Masses, \Nare a founder of a new dynasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.35,0:35:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am most grateful for your support, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.70,0:35:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I will never forget your great generosity, even in old age!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Good! Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.47,0:35:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}May I entertain you this once?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.18,0:35:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}I have a dancer in my house. Would you be interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.83,0:35:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good, very good...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.70,0:38:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.01,0:38:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A singer, Diāo Chán.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.63,0:38:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent... she's excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.42,0:38:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Her dancing is perfect, and she is even more perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.02,0:38:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Serve a cup to the Preceptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.71,0:38:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.06,0:38:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How young are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.51,0:39:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am only sixteen years of age.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.10,0:39:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're truly a deity amongst fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.10,0:39:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to present this woman to you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.10,0:39:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know whether you agree or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.18,0:39:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, since you've shown me so much kindness,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.39,0:39:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,what can I do to repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.35,0:39:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.03,0:39:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For her to be presented to you, sir, is a blessing!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.10,0:39:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You flatter me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Gracious Ducal Minister, gifting this lovely beauty to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.70,0:39:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,shows your great virtue indeed! I am very grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.62,0:39:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You flatter me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.15,0:39:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to respect you, this is the least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.43,0:39:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready my chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.62,0:39:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's return home!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.62,0:39:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send this lady to your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.86,0:40:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to escort me further, my good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.35,0:40:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do return.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.24,0:40:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, Grand Preceptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.74,0:40:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.34,0:40:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to trick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.47,0:40:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General, this is no place to talk. We'll talk inside.

